# =============================================================================
# Important Notes:
# 
# 1. Never commit .env files containing real secrets
# 2. Be careful with Docker volumes and bind mounts
# 3. Always review what you're committing with 'git status'
# 4. Use 'git add -p' for selective staging when unsure
# 
# =============================================================================
